  "rationale": "Setting decontam to none bypasses contaminant-based filtering and its statistics-merging step, but DECONTAM itself is invoked unconditionally and remains unaffected when the baseline samplesheet is retained. The unfiltered ASV sequences and abundance table propagate through subsequent filtering, taxonomy assignment, diversity analysis, statistical analysis and reporting, while upstream ASV generation and reference-only preparation remain unchanged. This prediction assumes a parameter-only adaptation of the baseline; genuinely removing negative-control samples would additionally require modifying the input samplesheet and could change DECONTAM execution and upstream processes."
